; error: 7:15: 'hold' is a reserved word with no use yet; a variable that changes is written 'flex'
; A pattern's names that may change may be written against the word,
; 'is flex(a, b)', so the message names the word to write there too.

task main()
    fixed t = (1, 2)
    when t is hold(a, b)
        show(a + b)
    fi
fi
